Register quickly and without KYC

To register, you don’t need to go through KYC, just enter your email and create the password. After registration, you immediately receive a crypto wallet and you can buy and sell cryptocurrency in a convenient way.

Trade with the whole world

Ads on the trading platform can be filtered by different parameters. For example, by price, country or payment method. In the application, you can trade with people from more than 160 countries.

Store your cryptocurrency securely

On Bitcoin Global, wallets are available for all coins on the platform. This means that you can safely store your coins, replenish wallets and withdraw funds from there.

Exchange cryptocurrency for fiat in a convenient way

50+ payment methods are waiting for you, for example, you can buy crypto with a credit card or even cash. Choose a fiat currency that is convenient for you, and buy bitcoin, ethereum and other available coins for it. The trading process is very simple: you just need to select an ad and write to the trader. Thanks to push notifications, you won’t miss a single message.

Track the current cryptocurrency rate

In the Bitcoin Global app, you can track the rate of cryptocurrencies online right in the app. This is useful if you want to actively trade and understand the state of the market.

Send cryptocurrency quickly and without fee

The application contains the codes of the WhiteBIT exchange. It’s an instant way to send cryptocurrency without fee. Enter the required amount and create a code. Then you can send it as payment or gift.

Earn money with the referral program

Copy your referral link and send it to a friend. After registering a friend, you will receive a percentage of his/her fees. More friends means more bonuses.

You can:

